ce-secret-department-coral-cult-name = Coral Cult
ce-secret-department-coral-cult-description = A secretive cult worshipping the coral beneath the station.

ce-secret-role-name-cult-leader = Cult Leader
ce-secret-role-description-cult-leader = Leads the Coral Cult's secret rituals.
ce-secret-role-briefing-cult-leader = You are the Cult Leader of the Coral Cult. Like your followers, you heed the coral's call and lead its secret rituals.

ce-secret-role-name-cultist = Cultist
ce-secret-role-description-cultist = A devoted member of the Coral Cult.
ce-secret-role-briefing-cultist = You are a Cultist. You've sworn loyalty to the Coral Cult and its secrets.

ce-secret-department-city-name = City
ce-secret-department-city-description = Ordinary station folk leading a double life in the shadows.

ce-secret-role-name-drunkard = Drunkard
ce-secret-role-description-drunkard = Never quite sober, always somewhere they shouldn't be.
ce-secret-role-briefing-drunkard = You are the Drunkard. Over a mug of ale, you hear more than you probably should.

ce-secret-role-name-detective = Detective
ce-secret-role-description-detective = Quietly digs into everyone else's business.
ce-secret-role-briefing-detective = You are the Detective. You have a habit of noticing what others try to hide.

ce-secret-role-name-drug-dealer = Drug Dealer
ce-secret-role-description-drug-dealer = Keeps the underground trade running.
ce-secret-role-briefing-drug-dealer = You are the Drug Dealer. The underground trade runs on people like you.

ce-secret-role-name-civilian = Peaceful Citizen
ce-secret-role-description-civilian = An ordinary resident, uninvolved in any secret business.
ce-secret-role-briefing-civilian = You are a Peaceful Citizen. No secret business to your name... yet.
